      "notes": "End-to-end validation on Electra One MK2 firmware 4.1.4. Scope: preset upload (/preset/upload), live mutation (/control/update), Lua scripting (/lua + /lua_script/upload), dynamic CC routes, preset arm/upload/switch flow, real-time CC push with smooth 100 Hz sweeps. Validated the full scripting.rs subsystem (ob.json_decode/encode, ob.send_sysex, ob.register_route, ob.set_current_page) against physical hardware."
